from filename "../../module/ffmpeg_hear.pya" ob name microphone hear to name hear be import do
su name prompt ob text "Focus the target app now. Recording from the microphone for 10 seconds before typing the transcript." be write do
su name note ob text "Override 'ffmpeg input' if your OS uses a different device (e.g., pipewire)." be write do
su name transcript from wo microphone during num 10 to filename "/tmp/pyash-hear-input.wav" be hear do
su name typed ob name transcript to wo keyboard be write do
